  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-plugin-harnessmm",
      "title": {
        "en": "HarnessMM — Guarded Decision Reuse",
        "zh": "HarnessMM 决策复用"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The model writes already-decided tool actions down once; when the previous tool result satisfies the guard it wrote, those actions run through the native tools without another reasoning request. Ships a read-only panel where every number traces back to the plugin state it came from.",
        "zh": "模型把已经想好的工具动作一次性写成动作库，上一步回执满足它自己写的守卫时，这些动作直接经原生工具执行，不再发起一次推理请求。附带只读面板，每个数字都能追溯回它来自的插件内部状态。"
      },
